{
    "background_story": "Jakai was a member of an ancient, otherworldly species known as the Prismoids. Hailing from a planet composed of crystalline structures, they possessed the unique ability to refract and manipulate light. Jakai's people had mastered the art of harnessing the power of prisms to sustain their ecosystem and wield incredible energy. As a skilled Prismoid warrior, Jakai was tasked with protecting their homeworld from an impending asteroid threat. With his prismoid abilities, he successfully deflected the asteroid, saving his planet from destruction. The Prismoids celebrated Jakai's heroism, and he became a legendary figure in their history, symbolizing the ingenuity and resilience of his people.",
